abraflexi-adminzone (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: pages did not load jQuery, so the account grids stayed empty
  * Data calls can run under a service account
    (ABRAFLEXI_LOGIN/PASSWORD) when the operator's AbraFlexi sessions
    are unusable; optional allow list ABRAFLEXI_ALLOWED_USERS
  * Sign-in refuses obsolete AbraFlexi sessions without a service
    account, checks access to the configured company
  * IPEX and SledovaniTV errors are shown instead of an empty list;
    AbraFlexi server and company shown in the menu
  * Grid look follows the ClientZone theme in dark and light mode;
    open_basedir fix

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:20:32 +0100

abraflexi-adminzone (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Focus on pairing of IPEX, Subreg and SledovaniTV accounts with
    AbraFlexi customers
  * Sign in with AbraFlexi token (form-encoded login, one-time password
    support)
  * New look shared with AbraFlexi ClientZone (Bootstrap 5, light/dark
    mode), logo and AppStream stock icon
  * Removed orders, invoices, reminders, matcher, webhooks, digests,
    LMS, mail sending, local database and all CLI scripts (moved to
    dedicated projects)
  * Security: login required on all pages, no credentials of external
    services in pages, errors without server details

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:18:42 +0100

